airunner (6.1.9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Prepare the services-only package for services 6.1.9 and native
    launcher 6.1.4; no Qt desktop client is included.
  * Refresh the bundled airunner-common files to 6.1.8 from the verified
    release wheel and record source and artifact hashes.
  * Keep FacehuggerShield out of default runtime requirements and make
    LLM settings load dotenv files only when DEV_ENV=1.
  * Add bounded headless eSpeak WAV rendering without local playback and
    expose the voice catalogue; omit OpenVoice vendor extras from the
    current Linux profile.
  * Bound API admission, setup work and public list queries; report setup
    completion truthfully and use real local-provider embedding results.
  * Preserve user data in guarded migration downgrades and stream ZIM
    document batches through the ingestion path.

